      "writtenOn": "2025-05-19T15:53:45Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The decision was driven by the differing maximum enrolled finger counts: `Helipilot` supports up to 5, while `Buccaneer` and `Gwendolin` will be limited to 3. This is likely an algorithm-specific constraint.\n\nI can rewrite it as such:\n\n```\nconfig FP_MAX_FINGER_COUNT\n\t  int \"Maximum number of loaded finger templates\"\n\t  default 5\n\t  help\n\t\tMax number of templates stored / matched against. This limit comes\n\t\tfrom memory constraints and matching time.\n```\n\nand then when I introduce `gwendolin`, I will override the default:\n\n```\nconfig FP_MAX_FINGER_COUNT\n\t  int \"Maximum number of loaded finger templates\"\n\t  default 3 if FINGERPRINT_SENSOR_EGIS630 \u0026\u0026 FP_EGIS_EGIS630_ALGORITHM\n\t  default 5\n\t  help\n\t\tMax number of templates stored / matched against. This limit comes\n\t\tfrom memory constraints and matching time.\n```",
      "parentUuid": "f255b4e6_fb508e71",
      "revId": "f3ad16af4d71505246aed8acec88057f033b6a0a",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
